### get contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### get a single contact by id
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6ab313eb49d5a30ed8359208
# GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6ab313d549d5a30ed8359206
# GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6ab3101049d5a30ed83591fe

### POST: create a new contact
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Jane", 
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "jane.doe@email.com",
    "favoriteColor": "blue",
    "birthday": "1990-05-12"
}

### PUT update contact
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/6ab3101049d5a30ed83591fe
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Jane", 
    "lastName": "Smith", 
    "email": "jane.smith@email.com",
    "favoriteColor": "purple", 
    "brthday": "1990-05-30"
}

### DELETE contact
DELETE http://localhost8080/contacts/6ab313eb49d5a30ed8359208

